<title>USA: Primex Technologies unit gets contract.</title>
<headline>Primex Technologies unit gets contract.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PETERSBURG, Fla. 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Primex Technologies Inc said its aerospace subsidiary has received a contract from Lockheed Martin Co's missiles and space division to produce a commercial communications satellite system.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>The contract covers the manufacture and test of four shipsets of hydrazine rocket engine assemblies and hydrazine arcjet thrusters.</p>
<p>Production of these units has begun and completion of this contract will be in early 1998, the company said.</p>
<p>(-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610)</p>
